OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of terrorism
OL,4,Coffence
OL,6,FA man from Wigston in Leicestershire
OL,7,Fhas been arrested on suspicion of a
OL,8,Fterrorism offence.
OL,10,FThe 27-year-old is being questioned
OL,11,Fabout allegedly supporting a
OL,12,Fproscribed group, called Daesh.
OL,14,FOfficers are searching a residential
OL,15,Fproperty in Wigston in connection to
OL,16,Fthe investigation.
OL,18,FOfficers from Counter Terrorism
OL,19,FPolicing South East worked with
OL,20,FLeicestershire Police in the planned
OL,21,Foperation.
OL,1,W~+$ ~sh7}h7sj5 ~{4~k4k4          G1/2
