PN,34902
SC,0002
CT,2,C
PS,c008
OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F349A1786020504
OL,3,CMan arrested on suspicion of terrorism
OL,4,Coffence
OL,6,FInspector Chris Day said: "I
OL,7,Fappreciate arrests of this nature may
OL,8,Fcause some people in the community to
OL,9,Ffeel concerned, however this arrest
OL,10,Ftoday took place as part of a pre-
OL,11,Fplanned operation. We are working to
OL,12,Fsupport our colleagues in Counter
OL,13,FTerrorism Policing as their
OL,14,Finvestigation continues.
OL,16,F"People in the local area may notice
OL,17,Fan increased police presence while
OL,18,Fsearch activity takes place. If anyone
OL,19,Fhas any concerns, or information they
OL,20,Fthink may be relevant, please speak to
OL,21,Fan officer."
